{"parse": {"title": "Blossom", "pageid": 239, "revid": 46678, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><center>\n<div class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-left: 4px solid #fa6622; border-right: 4px solid #ff2200; width: calc(70% + 30px); background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 40% 70%,#00000042 35%, #ff6600 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 0 9px 0 #f66900, 0 0 6px 0 #ff002447; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 85%; background-position-y: top; background-position-x: -13px; background-size: 150% 110%; margin: 6px 0 0; line-height: 1.25; color: #dcdce6;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Story\" title=\"Story\"><span style=\"font-size: 140%;color: hwb(240deg 86% 0%);\">Story Mode Meta Unit</span></a><br />This unit is one of the most effective units in the game for <a href=\"/wiki/Story\" title=\"Story\"><span style=\"color:white;\">Story Mode</span></a>!</div>\n</center>\n<center>\n<div class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-left: 4px solid #22FF22; border-right: 4px solid #55FF55; width: calc(70% + 30px); background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 40% 70%,#00000042 35%, #00FF00 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 0 9px 0 #22FF22, 0 0 6px 0 #ff002447; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 85%; background-position-y: top; background-position-x: -13px; background-size: 150% 110%; margin: 6px 0 0; line-height: 1.25; color: #dcdce6;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 140%;color: hwb(240deg 86% 0%);\">Meta Support Unit</span><br />This unit has one of the BEST supporting abilities in-game!<span style=\"font-size: 105%;\"></span></div>\n</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\"><b>Overview</b></span></h2>\n<p><b>Blossom</b> is a <span class=\"C(Rare) game-font-face\">Rare</span> unit. She is only obtainable through <a href=\"/wiki/Summon\" title=\"Summon\">summons</a>. Upon deployment, she buffs the damage of units within her range. She also heals/adds the base HP every wave.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stats_Overview\">Stats Overview</span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-character\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Blossom</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"deployment_cost\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Deployment Cost</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 3px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black;color: #ffc608;\">600¥</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"total_cost\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Total Cost</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 3px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black;color: #ffc608;\">4,600¥</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"upgrade_levels\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Upgrade Levels</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"spawn_cap\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Spawn Cap</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Tower_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Tower Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Hybrid BUFF</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Attack Stats</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damage\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Damage</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"seconds_per_attack\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Attack Rate</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"range\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Range</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5 -&gt; 8</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"mobile-hidden game-font-face advanced-tooltip\" style=\"position: relative; user-select: none;z-index: 5;color: #ffffff8f;font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"dottedText C(#3a3a3a)-Th-L\" style=\"position: absolute; top: -43px; right: 0; cursor: help; border-bottom: 2px dotted;\">Why do I have different stats?</div><div class=\"tooltip-contents\" style=\"display: none\"><div class=\"game-tooltip&#95;&#95;container game-font-face\">Units in this game use a randomized system, where stats like damage are randomly rolled with about a 10% variance (like Dungeon Quest items). When you evolve a unit they also reroll their stats, but it will always be strictly better than the pre-evolved version.</div></div></div><div class=\"article-table mobileonly\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Frequently_Asked_Questions\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions\">Why do I have different stats?</a></i><br /></div><div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; z-index: 5;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; width: 124px; justify-content: flex-start; position: absolute; left: 234px; top: -48px; flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: center;\">\n<div class=\"mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;OFF mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; width: 100px;\">\n<div cla