mw-headline\" id=\"Upgrade_3_-_2,000¥\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\"><span>Upgrade 3 - <span class=\"game-font-face Tsh(Game) C(Yen)\">2,000¥</span></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"font-size: 90%; align-self: center; gap: 9px; display: flex; padding: 0 9px;\"> </span></div></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Range: <span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\">8</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\" style=\"display: none;\">9.<small>6</small></span></li><li>Spawn: 100 HP</li>   </ul>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"Stats-Box\" id=\"Stats-Box-ON\">\n<div class=\"buffEffect&#95;&#95;box H(100%) W(100%)\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;SakuroAuraBuff H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sakura\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;DedicateYourHearts H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;KannonbirakiBenihimeAratame H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Upgrade_3_-_2.2C000.C2.A5_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Upgrade_3_-_2,000¥_2\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\"><span>Upgrade 3 - <span class=\"game-font-face Tsh(Game) C(Yen)\">2,000¥</span></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"font-size: 90%; align-self: center; gap: 9px; display: flex; padding: 0 9px;\"> </span></div></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Range: <span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\">8</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\">9.<small>6</small></span></li><li>Spawn: 920.<small>41</small> HP</li>   </ul>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box&#95;&#95;Container\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\">\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box\" id=\"click-on-I-Box-OFF\">⁣⁣⁣⁣click on any part of the information block</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box\" id=\"click-on-I-Box-ON\">⁣⁣⁣⁣click on any part of the information block</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><br />\nNote that her buff doesn't stack with <a href=\"/wiki/Idol_(Star)\" title=\"Idol (Star)\">Idol</a>'s.\n</p><p>Her buff also stacks with <a href=\"/wiki/Commander\" title=\"Commander\">Commander</a> making the Physical buff reach up to 35% - 110%.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Selling\">Selling</span></h2>\n<p>Units sell for 25% of the sum of their deployment cost and upgrades.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>On Update 9.0.0, she used to heal 25 HP of tower HP per wave (stacks each unit), now she heals 3%-5% each wave (stacks each unit).</li>\n<li>As of Update 12.5.0, she, <a href=\"/wiki/Idol_(Star)\" title=\"Idol (Star)\">Idol (Star)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton_(Soul_King)\" title=\"Skeleton (Soul King)\">Skeleton (Soul King)</a> are the only ones capable of buffing both Physical and Magical damage.\n<ul><li>She's the only character that can still be obtained as of now.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Before Update 4.0, she was a ground unit, meaning she could not be deployed on hill areas.</li>\n<li>Before Update&#160;???, her damage buff was 5% instead of 10%.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022015929\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.123 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.145 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1284/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 82330/2097152 bytes\nTemplate 